list.item:
Right of US forces to act in own security in emergency is nailed down;
                            such action must be immediately followed by, but is not conditional upon
                            info to Jap Govt, whose vital interest it is impossible to deny.

Alternatives before us are, broadly, 
                                (a)

Accept text given above;
                                (b)

Delete Art 22 and discuss entire matter later;


                                (c)

Use only short general sentence, then consult later;
                                (d)

Prolong negotiations here to try obtain difference between
                                    above text and our second draft.
